### Visual Studio / Rider / VS Code (REST Client) ile denemek için
@host = http://localhost:5080
@token = buraya-login-yanitindaki-accessToken

### Sağlık kontrolü
GET {{host}}/health

### Kayıt
POST {{host}}/api/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "ayse@example.com",
  "password": "Sifre1234",
  "displayName": "Ayşe"
}

### Giriş
POST {{host}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "ayse@example.com",
  "password": "Sifre1234"
}

### Kategoriler
GET {{host}}/api/categories

### Okeye 4. aranıyor (capacity = 1)
POST {{host}}/api/events
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "categoryId": 1,
  "title": "Okeye 4. aranıyor",
  "description": "Moda'da çay bahçesindeyiz, 3 kişiyiz.",
  "startsAt": "2026-12-01T17:00:00Z",
  "latitude": 40.9862,
  "longitude": 29.0253,
  "placeName": "Moda Çay Bahçesi",
  "capacity": 1,
  "joinPolicy": "Open"
}

### Yakınımdaki etkinlikler (Kadıköy, 5 km)
GET {{host}}/api/events/nearby?lat=40.9903&lng=29.0290&radiusKm=5
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Etkinlik detayı
GET {{host}}/api/events/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Katıl
POST {{host}}/api/events/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000/join
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Oy ver (1-5)
PUT {{host}}/api/events/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000/rating
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "score": 5,
  "comment": "Çok keyifliydi!"
}

### Profilim (organizatör puan ortalaması dahil)
GET {{host}}/api/users/me
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Bildirimlerim (en yeni önce)
GET {{host}}/api/notifications?page=1&pageSize=20
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Okunmamış bildirim sayısı
GET {{host}}/api/notifications/unread-count
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Tüm bildirimleri okundu yap
POST {{host}}/api/notifications/read-all
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Push token'ı kaydet (development build'de uygulama kendisi yapar)
POST {{host}}/api/devices
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "token": "ExponentPushToken[xxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxx]",
  "platform": "android"
}

### Şikayet et (Event | User | Message; Spam | Inappropriate | Harassment | Dangerous | Fake | Other)
POST {{host}}/api/reports
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "targetType": "Event", "targetId": "00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000", "reason": "Inappropriate", "details": "..." }

### [Yönetici] Açık şikayetler (önce: UPDATE users SET is_admin = true WHERE email = '...';)
GET {{host}}/api/admin/reports
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### [Yönetici] Şikayeti sonuçlandır: Dismiss | RemoveContent | BanUser
POST {{host}}/api/admin/reports/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000/resolve
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "action": "RemoveContent", "note": "Uygunsuz başlık" }
